# NewCo tokens — local env example.
#
# There is NO Figma REST/Variables API sync in this repo. The org is not on the
# Enterprise plan, so the Variables REST API is not available. Token seeds under
# tokens/figma-source/*.json are refreshed from Figma via the Dev-Mode/plugin
# (MCP) pull run from a session, then `npm run build-all` regenerates everything.
# Nothing here reads a Figma file at build time.
#
# The only Figma token this repo can use is a PERSONAL access token for Figma
# Code Connect, and only when you publish Code Connect mappings by hand:
#   FIGMA_ACCESS_TOKEN=figd_xxx   npm run figma:connect
# It is never needed to build tokens or ship the packages. Never commit a real value.
FIGMA_ACCESS_TOKEN=figd_xxx_personal_access_token_for_code_connect_only
